> Is there any way for me to easily identify Identify?   

Quantity is a risky second-bet option.  Identify is by far the 
most common scroll, but more often than not this method backfires.  
However, at your level and with usual care, you should be capable 
of dealing with all possible outcomes.  Go to level one, put 
off all armor, have a wand of teleport ready and read the most 
common scrolls you found.  

If you have maximum luck and a magic marker to spare, you can 
also try and write an id scroll; if successful (about 1/3 chance 
for luck-maxed non-wizards, IIRC), you get an id scroll with the 
usual name 'a scroll called $whatever'.  

You could also try for illiterate; seems like you're on a good 
way so far.  

